{
  "source": "course-assets/why-answers-vary/why-answers-vary.mp4",
  "duration": 182.4426875,
  "segments": [
    {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 2.92,
      "text": "You ask AI, what should I name my new dog?"
    },
    {
      "start": 3.48,
      "end": 4.66,
      "text": "It suggests Spot."
    },
    {
      "start": 5.42,
      "end": 8.14,
      "text": "You start a new chat and ask the exact same question."
    },
    {
      "start": 8.68,
      "end": 10.42,
      "text": "This time, it suggests Max."
    },
    {
      "start": 11.22,
      "end": 13.74,
      "text": "Why did the same question get a different answer?"
    },
    {
      "start": 14.52,
      "end": 17.02,
      "text": "Three main components dictate an AI's response."
    },
    {
      "start": 17.74,
      "end": 19.34,
      "text": "First, the model you use"
    },
    {
      "start": 19.34,
      "end": 21.46,
      "text": "and its thinking time changes the answer."
    },
    {
      "start": 22.0,
      "end": 23.74,
      "text": "Second, what the AI receives,"
    },
    {
      "start": 24.1,
      "end": 25.88,
      "text": "your prompt and provided context."
    },
    {
      "start": 26.44,
      "end": 29.2,
      "text": "But the third column is where the real mechanics live."
    },
    {
      "start": 29.2,
      "end": 32.34,
      "text": "AI uses techniques giving different tokens a chance,"
    },
    {
      "start": 32.9,
      "end": 34.08,
      "text": "sampling and temperature."
    },
    {
      "start": 34.96,
      "end": 36.56,
      "text": "Take a look at this probabilities chart."
    },
    {
      "start": 37.18,
      "end": 40.12,
      "text": "The AI has generated the phrase, you could name him"
    },
    {
      "start": 40.12,
      "end": 43.18,
      "text": "and is evaluating its options for the next open blank."
    },
    {
      "start": 44.52,
      "end": 48.08,
      "text": "At this exact blank, the AI calculates a probability"
    },
    {
      "start": 48.08,
      "end": 50.12,
      "text": "for every token in its vocabulary."
    },
    {
      "start": 50.74,
      "end": 54.42,
      "text": "Right now, spot leads the starting odds at 22%."
    },
    {
      "start": 54.42,
      "end": 57.28,
      "text": "You might expect the AI to pick the winner automatically"
    },
    {
      "start": 57.28,
      "end": 64.38,
      "text": "But a 22% probability means AI would pick Spot about 22 times out of 100 dries, on"
    },
    {
      "start": 64.38,
      "end": 66.2,
      "text": "average, if the odds stay the same."
    },
    {
      "start": 66.74,
      "end": 67.56,
      "text": "That's called sampling."
    },
    {
      "start": 68.38,
      "end": 73.56,
      "text": "If we run five separate random picks with these exact unchanged probabilities, we get"
    },
    {
      "start": 73.56,
      "end": 74.62,
      "text": "a specific sequence."
    },
    {
      "start": 75.28,
      "end": 76.5,
      "text": "Pick one, Max."
    },
    {
      "start": 77.08,
      "end": 78.42,
      "text": "Pick two, Spot."
    },
    {
      "start": 79.06,
      "end": 80.34,
      "text": "Pick three, Buddy."
    },
    {
      "start": 81.0,
      "end": 82.3,
      "text": "Pick four, Rex."
    },
    {
      "start": 82.92,
      "end": 84.52,
      "text": "And pick five, Max."
    },
    {
      "start": 84.52,
      "end": 88.38,
      "text": "Spot was picked only once, even with the highest probability."
    },
    {
      "start": 89.06,
      "end": 91.6,
      "text": "Another five picks could turn out entirely differently."
    },
    {
      "start": 92.14,
      "end": 93.46,
      "text": "Why does AI work this way?"
    },
    {
      "start": 94.36,
      "end": 97.52,
      "text": "Choosing the absolute most likely token every single time"
    },
    {
      "start": 97.52,
      "end": 101.16,
      "text": "makes the AI's answers rigid, predictable, and highly repetitive."
    },
    {
      "start": 101.76,
      "end": 104.32,
      "text": "Giving other likely tokens a chance to be selected"
    },
    {
      "start": 104.32,
      "end": 106.08,
      "text": "introduces essential variety."
    },
    {
      "start": 106.82,
      "end": 109.46,
      "text": "It makes the generated text feel more creative"
    },
    {
      "start": 109.46,
      "end": 111.06,
      "text": "and natural to a human reader."
    },
    {
      "start": 111.06,
      "end": 114.3,
      "text": "Choosing a different token shapes what comes next."
    },
    {
      "start": 114.9,
      "end": 117.86,
      "text": "One slightly different token choice at a critical juncture"
    },
    {
      "start": 117.86,
      "end": 122.78,
      "text": "can send the entire remainder of the generated answer in a completely new direction."
    },
    {
      "start": 123.74,
      "end": 125.96,
      "text": "Sampling selects a token using probabilities."
    },
    {
      "start": 126.88,
      "end": 128.6,
      "text": "Temperature adjusts those probabilities."
    },
    {
      "start": 129.48,
      "end": 134.12,
      "text": "In ChatGPT, Gemini, and Claude, temperature is set for you behind the scenes."
    },
    {
      "start": 134.42,
      "end": 138.56,
      "text": "This chart compares how different temperature settings change the odds for each dog name."
    },
    {
      "start": 139.24,
      "end": 142.52,
      "text": "Notice the center column. These are the starting odds"
    },
    {
      "start": 142.52,
      "end": 145.72,
      "text": "derived directly from the model's training and the context you provided."
    },
    {
      "start": 146.6,
      "end": 150.22,
      "text": "A low temperature setting concentrates the odds onto the most likely choices."
    },
    {
      "start": 151.16,
      "end": 154.8,
      "text": "Spot leads at 22%, but at low temperature, its chance"
    },
    {
      "start": 154.8,
      "end": 158.78,
      "text": "jumps to 36%. A high temperature setting does the opposite"
    },
    {
      "start": 158.78,
      "end": 162.7,
      "text": "by spreading the odds out more widely. Here, Spot's"
    },
    {
      "start": 162.7,
      "end": 166.46,
      "text": "chance falls to 16%. Both settings manipulate"
    },
    {
      "start": 166.46,
      "end": 170.32,
      "text": "the exact same starting odds. Spot remains the most likely individual"
    },
    {
      "start": 170.32,
      "end": 176.54,
      "text": "token at all three settings. Temperature changes its probability. AI answers vary."
    },
    {
      "start": 177.12,
      "end": 179.98,
      "text": "Different inputs. Different odds. Different choices."
    }
  ],
